# ── Demolisher ──
Demolisher.Name: Demolisher
Demolisher.Blurb: Smash walls to open new paths
Demolisher.Help: Use the hammer button to smash the wall in front of you. The wall breaks on everyone's screen and becomes a path. The cooldown and number of uses are in the settings below.
Demolisher.SmashCooldown: Hammer Cooldown
Demolisher.SmashUses: Hammer Uses (0 = unlimited)
Demolisher.Hammer: Hammer

# ── Lighter ──
Lighter.Name: Lighter
Lighter.Blurb: See further than the rest
Lighter.Help: A crewmate who sees farther than others (the multiplier is in the settings below). Keep watch from afar and report what you saw in meetings.
Lighter.VisionMultiplier: Vision Multiplier

# ── Portal Maker (PortalMaker) ──
PortalMaker.Name: Portal Maker
PortalMaker.Blurb: Link two places with portals
PortalMaker.Help: Press the button to place a portal at your feet. Once two are placed, any living player can stand on one and press Use to travel to the other. Press again after placing both to remove them and place again (can be turned off). A portal breaks after three hits from the Demolisher's hammer.
PortalMaker.PlaceCooldown: Portal Cooldown
PortalMaker.CanRemove: Press Again to Remove Portals
PortalMaker.Portal: Portal

# ── Quickdraw ──
Quickdraw.Name: Quickdraw
Quickdraw.Blurb: Strike again before anyone else
Quickdraw.Help: An impostor whose kill cooldown is shorter than the room setting (the seconds are in the settings below).
Quickdraw.KillCooldown: Kill Cooldown

# ── Jester ──
Jester.Name: Jester
Jester.Blurb: Get yourself voted out
Jester.Help: A neutral role. Get voted out in a meeting to win alone. You cannot kill, so act suspicious and draw votes.

# ── Outlaw ──
Outlaw.Name: Outlaw
Outlaw.Blurb: Be the last one standing
Outlaw.Help: A neutral killer. You keep your crewmate look but have a kill button (kill cooldown, vision and kill distance are under "Neutral Killers" in the Game Settings tab). You win when no impostors are left and the remaining survivors are no more than the Outlaws. Impostors are your enemies too.

# ── Survivor ──
Survivor.Name: Survivor
Survivor.Blurb: Stay alive until the end
Survivor.Help: A neutral role. Whoever wins, you win with them if you are still alive at the end of the game.

# ── Hawkeye ──
Hawkeye.Name: Hawkeye
Hawkeye.Blurb: See further than the rest
Hawkeye.Help: An add-on that widens your vision (the multiplier is in the settings below). The settings decide which teams can get it.
Hawkeye.VisionPercent: Vision

# ── Quickhands ──
Quickhands.Name: Quickhands
Quickhands.Blurb: Strike again sooner
Quickhands.Help: An add-on that shortens your kill cooldown. Only players who can kill (impostors and roles with a kill button) can get it.
Quickhands.Reduction: Cooldown Reduction

# ── Sensitive ──
Sensitive.Name: Sensitive
Sensitive.Blurb: Sense it when someone falls
Sensitive.Help: When someone is killed, your screen alone flashes red for a moment. It does not tell you who or where.
Sensitive.Strength: Flash Strength

